<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">WISER: Wider Search, Deeper Thinking, and Adaptive Fusion for Training-Free Zero-Shot Composed Image Retrieval</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
