<figure id="S4.T2" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering" style="font-size:90%;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 2: </span><span id="S4.T2.10" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Comparison with the state-of-the-art methods on the validation set of Fashion-IQ.</span> The best results are in <span id="S4.T2.11" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">bold</span>, while the second-best results are <span id="S4.T2.12" class="ltx_text ltx_underline">underlined</span>. Our method is highlighted in grey.</figcaption>
<table id="S4.T2.13" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_align_middle">
<tr id="S4.T2.13.1" class="ltx_tr">
